---
config:
  look: handDrawn
---
graph TD
  Root[Project Root]
  Root --> Make[Makefile]
  Root --> Inv[inventory.yaml]
  Root --> Site[site.yaml]
  Root --> Roles[roles/]

  Make -->|runs| Site
  Inv -->|provides host groups and variables| Site

  subgraph RoleTree[roles/]
    Active[Active install roles\npackages, ssh, ai]
    Remove[Remove roles\n*_remove]
    Archived[Archived roles\nkept inactive but available]
  end

  Roles --> Active
  Roles --> Remove
  Roles --> Archived

  Site -->|conditionally imports| Active
  Site -->|conditionally imports| Remove
  Archived -.->|not imported by default| Site
  Inv -.->|may retain matching groups| Archived